        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Kamu adalah AI Creative Director. Tugasmu menganalisis naskah konten dan mengubahnya menjadi deskripsi visual siap pakai untuk generate gambar AI. WAJIB terapkan brand guideline ini secara konsisten di SEMUA prompt: Gaya = {{ $('Set - Brand Guidelines & Setup').item.json.brand_style }} | Warna = {{ $('Set - Brand Guidelines & Setup').item.json.brand_colors }}. Balas HANYA dalam format JSON, tanpa teks tambahan, tanpa markdown code fence."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Naskah dari Sesi 2:\n\n{{ $('Set - Brand Guidelines & Setup').item.json.naskah }}\n\nTugas:\n1. Pecah naskah menjadi maksimal 6 scene visual utama.\n2. Untuk tiap scene, buat 1 visual_prompt dalam BAHASA INGGRIS, detail, siap dipakai untuk generate gambar, dan WAJIB menyertakan elemen brand guideline di atas.\n3. Sertakan scene_title singkat, scene_description (1 kalimat, Bahasa Indonesia), dan mood_tags (3 kata kunci).\n\nFormat balasan (JSON object, HANYA ini, tanpa teks lain):\n{\n  \"scenes\": [\n    { \"scene_number\": 1, \"scene_title\": \"...\", \"scene_description\": \"...\", \"visual_prompt\": \"...\", \"mood_tags\": [\"...\",\"...\",\"...\"] }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a6b3c7a7-7e1b-4316-83aa-923c2f43e00a",
      "name": "Message a model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        640,
        1328
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "fOLTtgMvBiFfnxZ6",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\n\n// Support v2+ \"Message a model\" node: output[0].content[0].text\n// Also support legacy OpenAI shapes as fallbacks\nlet raw = item?.output?.[0]?.content?.[0]?.text\n  ?? item?.message?.content\n  ?? item?.choices?.[0]?.message?.content\n  ?? item?.content\n  ?? item?.text\n  ?? (Array.isArray(item?.output) ? '' : item?.output)\n  ?? '';\n\nraw = String(raw).replace(/```json/gi, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();\n\nlet parsed;\ntry {\n  parsed = JSON.parse(raw);\n} catch (e) {\n  throw new Error('Gagal parse JSON dari OpenAI. Error: ' + e.message + ' | Raw: ' + raw.slice(0, 300));\n}\n\nconst brand = $('Set - Brand Guidelines & Setup').first().json;\nconst scenes = parsed.scenes || parsed;\n\nreturn scenes.map((scene, idx) => ({\n  json: {\n    scene_number: scene.scene_number || (idx + 1),\n    scene_title: scene.scene_title || ('Scene ' + (idx + 1)),\n    scene_description: scene.scene_description || '',\n    visual_prompt: scene.visual_prompt,\n    mood_tags: scene.mood_tags || [],\n    project_name: brand.project_name,\n    row_number: brand.row_number,\n    file_name: brand.project_name + '_scene' + (scene.scene_number || (idx + 1)) + '.png'\n  }\n}));"
      },
